# Login Form Project

## Project Description
This project is a simple login form created
using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

## Features
- Username input
- Password input
- Login button
- Empty field validation
- Simple and clean design

## How to Use
1. Open index.html in your browser.
2. Enter your username.
3. Enter your password.
4. Click the Login button.
5. If a field is empty, an error message
   will appear.

